  ["8 cloud-itonami blueprints (plumbing isco-7126, construction F4211,
    freight-driving isco-8332, freight-transport H4920, home-nursing
    isco-2221, care-coordination Q8810, market-gardening isco-6112, retail
    G4711) each get a standalone network-isekai game under
    public/games/itonami/<slug>/ (game.edn + scene.edn + logic.cljc,
    kami-clj guest subset, auto-discovered by isekai.feed-index)"
   "shared 'depot loop' mechanic maps the blueprint's intake→propose→
    approve→execute→audit operating-states onto network-isekai primitives:
    depot touch = governor approval (defatom equipped flag), job-site touch
    while equipped = execute (spawns done/score/picked markers, resets
    equipped), touch while unequipped = governor violation (docks a life
    marker, cooldown-gated), :flow :victory :when-picked <job-count> = audit
    close-out, :flow :gameover :when-missing player on 0 lives"
   "sprites stay hand-composed kami.sprite2d primitives (drive/orbs/
    goriketsu convention), not kami-isekai-assets chargen — different genre
    register (trade/care/logistics sim vs isekai/tensei RPG)"
   "pilot scope only: 8 of 111 cloud-itonami repos, not a batch job over the
    full registry; prototypes are uncommitted in the working tree pending
    review before push"]
